...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
collector: SignalCollector { class: ours }
openai: OpenAI API { class: ext }
relevance: RelevanceAgent { class: ours }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
risk: RiskAgent { class: ours }

user -> ui: 소스 선택 + Run 클릭
ui -> collector: collect(raw_signals)
collector -> ui: 정규화·중복 제거된 신호
ui -> relevance: score_batch(normalized)
relevance -> openai: gpt-4.1-mini 호출 (관련성 채점)
openai -> relevance: "JSON (score, reasoning)"
relevance -> ui: relevance 필드가 붙은 신호
ui -> risk: assess_batch(scored)
risk -> openai: gpt-4.1-mini 호출 (위험 평가)
openai -> risk: "JSON (risk_level, concerns)"
risk -> ui: risk 필드가 붙은 신호
